# No promotion without evidence

- Do not rewrite ledger decisions in docs or READMEs.
- `direction_supported` and `not_confirmed` are not production policy.
- Shape-Beat (`future-shape-beat-architecture.md`) is proposed, not implemented.
- Do not promote on fluency, Recall@10 alone, or scaffold richness.
- Pilot metrics belong in `docs/architecture/experiment-ledger.md`, not `AGENTS.md` or rules.
- Experiment READMEs document local runs; the ledger is the compact decision record.
